
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>ManFound — Official Website</title>

    <meta name="description" content="Official ManFound website. Find our Privacy Policy, Terms of Service, Community Guidelines, Child Safety Standards, Meetup and Travel Safety Guidelines, and Account Deletion information.">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #f7f7f8;
            color: #222;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #17112b;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 65px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 46px;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        header p {
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            font-size: 19px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 45px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .intro {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .intro h2 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #17112b;
        }

        .intro p {
            color: #555;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }

        .links {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .link {
            display: block;
            padding: 18px;
            background: #f1f0f5;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #17112b;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.2s ease;
        }

        .link:hover {
            background: #e5e3eb;
        }

        .link strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 17px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .link span {
            display: block;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 35px 20px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #17112b;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            header {
                padding: 50px 20px;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            header p {
                font-size: 17px;
            }

            .card {
                padding: 22px;
            }

            .links {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>ManFound</h1>
    <p>Be Found.</p>
</header>

<main>

    <section class="intro">
        <h2>Official ManFound Information</h2>

        <p>
            ManFound is a social app for adult men to form respectful
            connections, meet in real life, learn, travel, and build
            communities.
        </p>

        <p>
            This website provides official information about our policies,
            safety standards, and account management.
        </p>
    </section>

    <div class="card">

        <div class="links">

            <a class="link" href="privacy-policy">
                <strong>Privacy Policy</strong>
                <span>How ManFound handles information and privacy.</span>
            </a>

            <a class="link" href="terms-of-service">
                <strong>Terms of Service</strong>
                <span>The terms governing use of ManFound.</span>
            </a>

            <a class="link" href="community-guidelines">
                <strong>Community Guidelines</strong>
                <span>Rules for respectful and safe participation.</span>
            </a>

            <a class="link" href="child-safety-standards">
                <strong>Child Safety Standards</strong>
                <span>ManFound's 18+ policy and child-safety standards.</span>
            </a>

            <a class="link" href="meetup-travel-safety">
                <strong>Meetup &amp; Travel Safety</strong>
                <span>Safety guidance for in-person meetups and travel.</span>
            </a>

            <a class="link" href="account-deletion">
                <strong>Account Deletion</strong>
                <span>Information about deleting your ManFound account.</span>
            </a>

        </div>

    </div>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 ManFound. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
```
